<title>PORTUGAL: POLL - Portugal spreads vs Bunds, Spanish Bonos.</title>
<headline>POLL - Portugal spreads vs Bunds, Spanish Bonos.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the daily forecast for spreads in the Portuguese bond market based on a poll of three banks and one brokerage.</p>
<p>Poll covers spreads between the February 2007 Portuguese cash bond (OT) and the German and Spanish equivalents, together with the spreads between the Portuguese 10 and two-year bonds.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>			     Min spread Max  vs previous close</p>
<p>Feb 07 vs Bund July  07   69 bps  71	    67</p>
<p>Feb 07 vs Bono March 07   02	05	    04</p>
<p>						  YLDS3</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>				 Min  Max</p>
<p>Feb 07 vs March 99	 98   105		100</p>
<p>						  PT/CURVE</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Key factors likely to affect market:</p>
<p>- Trade will be influenced by concern that Germany could raise rates to counteract weak mark and recent dollar strength, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
